 *   MCP3008 3  -> SCLK  (GPIO11)
 *   MCP3008 0  -> CS0   (GPIO8)
 *   MCP3008 1  -> CS1   (GPIO7)
 *   MCP3008 2  -> CS2   (GPIO25)
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o soil_moisture_logger soil_moisture_logger.c
